        <mxCell id="char-text" value="&lt;b&gt;Strengths:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Native asset modelling (hierarchies)&lt;br&gt;• Built-in time-series aggregations&lt;br&gt;• Managed IoT platform&lt;br&gt;• Real-time latency (&amp;lt;1s)&lt;br&gt;• OPC-UA/Modbus support&lt;br&gt;• Compute expressions (no Lambda)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Challenges:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• NOT designed for multi-tenant SaaS&lt;br&gt;• Tag-based isolation (manual)&lt;br&gt;• Can&#39;t white-label SiteWise Monitor&lt;br&gt;• Most expensive option ($211/tenant)&lt;br&gt;• Requires Timestream for events&lt;br&gt;• Complex tenant data segregation&lt;br&gt;• 28-week implementation&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cost&lt;/b&gt;: $6,334/month&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Team&lt;/b&gt;: 3-4 engineers&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Timeline&lt;/b&gt;: 28 weeks&lt;br&gt;B&lt;b&gt;est for:&lt;/b&gt; Single Site deployments" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
